    "method": [
      "分部积分法",
      "极限运算",
      "比较判别法"
    ],
    "solution_steps": [
      "(1-a) 用分部积分计算定积分 $\\int_0^t xe^{-x}dx$",
      "(1-b) 对(1-a)结果取极限 $t \\to \\infty$",
      "(1-c) 利用(1-b)结果通过比较判别法证明收敛"
    ],
    "math_structure": {
      "type": "integration_by_parts_sequence",
      "template": "$\\int_0^a xe^{-x}dx$ 的分部积分及其极限行为",
      "variable_count": 2
    },
    "difficulty": 2,
    "answer": [
      {
        "label": "(1-a) 定积分计算",
        "steps": [
          "使用分部积分法，设 $u = x, dv = e^{-x}dx$",
          "则 $du = dx, v = -e^{-x}$",
          "$$\\int_0^t xe^{-x}dx = \\left[-xe^{-x}\\right]_0^t + \\int_0^t e^{-x}dx$$",
          "$$= -te^{-t} + \\left[-e^{-x}\\right]_0^t = -te^{-t} - e^{-t} + 1$$",
          "$$= 1 - (t+1)e^{-t}$$"
        ]
      },
      {
        "label": "(1-b) 广义积分计算",
        "steps": [
          "由(1-a)的结果，令 $t \\to \\infty$：",
          "$$\\int_0^{\\infty} xe^{-x}dx = \\lim_{t \\to \\infty}\\left[1 - (t+1)e^{-t}\\right]$$",
          "因为 $\\lim_{t \\to \\infty}(t+1)e^{-t} = 0$（指数函数衰减快于幂函数增长）",
          "所以 $\\int_0^{\\infty} xe^{-x}dx = 1$"
        ]
      },
      {
        "label": "(1-c) 收敛性证明",
        "steps": [
          "对于 $x > 0$，有 $|\\sin(\\sqrt{x})| \\le 1$",
          "因此 $|xe^{-x}\\sin(\\sqrt{x})| \\le xe^{-x}$",
          "由(1-b)知 $\\int_0^{\\infty} xe^{-x}dx = 1$ 收敛",
          "由比较判别法，$\\int_0^{\\infty} xe^{-x}\\sin(\\sqrt{x})dx$ 绝对收敛",
          "所以该广义积分收敛"
        ]
      }
    ],
    "practice_questions": [
      {
        "text": "求积分 $\\int_0^t (x+1)e^{-x}dx$，并讨论当 $t \\to \\infty$ 时的极限。",
