        "difficulty": 1,
        "estimated_minutes": 8,
        "answer": [
          {
            "label": "完整解答",
            "steps": [
              "分别计算两项：",
              "$$\\int_0^t e^{-x}dx = 1 - e^{-t}$$",
              "$$\\int_0^t xe^{-x}dx = 1 - (t+1)e^{-t}$$（由题目已知）",
              "$$\\int_0^t (x+1)e^{-x}dx = [1 - (t+1)e^{-t}] + [1 - e^{-t}] = 2 - (t+2)e^{-t}$$",
              "当 $t \\to \\infty$ 时，$(t+2)e^{-t} \\to 0$，所以极限为 $2$"
            ]
          }
        ],
