  {
    "id": "kobe-2025-3dacc32c2e-q01",
    "school": "神户大学",
    "year": "2025",
    "subject": "系统情报学研究科_全专攻",
    "text": "设$f(x)$为定义在区间$[0,1]$上的非负连续函数。对任意$b > 0$，证明存在$a \\in [0,1]$使得等式 $\\int_0^a f(x)dx = b\\int_a^1 f(x)dx$ 成立；当$f(x) = \\frac{1}{1+x^2}$，$b = 2$时，求$a$的值。",
    "knowledge_points": [
      "定积分的性质",
      "连续函数的中值定理",
      "积分方程",
      "积分计算"
    ],
    "question_type": "证明与计算",
    "method": [
      "利用连续函数的中值定理",
      "构造辅助函数",
      "分析函数的单调性"
    ],
    "solution_steps": [
      "设$F(x) = \\int_0^x f(t)dt$，$G(x) = b\\int_x^1 f(t)dt$",
      "分析$F(x) - G(x)$的端点值",
      "由连续函数的零点定理得存在性",
      "对具体函数计算积分"
    ],
    "math_structure": {
      "type": "integral_equation",
      "template": "$\\int_0^a f(x)dx = b\\int_a^1 f(x)dx$",
      "variable_count": 2
    },
    "difficulty": 3,
    "answer": [
      {
        "label": "存在性证明",
        "steps": [
          "设$F(x) = \\int_0^x f(t)dt - b\\int_x^1 f(t)dt$",
          "则$F(0) = -b\\int_0^1 f(t)dt \\leq 0$",
          "而$F(1) = \\int_0^1 f(t)dt \\geq 0$",
          "由连续函数的中值定理，存在$a \\in [0,1]$使$F(a) = 0$，即$\\int_0^a f(x)dx = b\\int_a^1 f(x)dx$"
        ]
      },
      {
        "label": "求a的值",
        "steps": [
          "计算$\\int_0^1 \\frac{1}{1+x^2}dx = \\arctan(1) - \\arctan(0) = \\frac{\\pi}{4}$",
          "需要$\\int_0^a \\frac{1}{1+x^2}dx = 2\\int_a^1 \\frac{1}{1+x^2}dx$",
          "即$\\arctan(a) = 2(\\frac{\\pi}{4} - \\arctan(a))$",
          "所以$3\\arctan(a) = \\frac{\\pi}{2}$，得$\\arctan(a) = \\frac{\\pi}{6}$",
          "因此$a = \\tan(\\frac{\\pi}{6}) = \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{3}} = \\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{3}$"
        ]
      }
    ],
    "practice_questions": [
      {
        "text": "设$f(x) = 1$为常函数，$b > 0$为给定常数。证明存在$a \\in [0,1]$使得$\\int_0^a 1\\,dx = b\\int_a^1 1\\,dx$，并求$a$的值。",
        "knowledge_points": [
          "定积分",
          "代数方程求解"
        ],
        "question_type": "证明与计算",
        "method": [
          "建立关于a的方程",
          "代数求解"
        ],
        "solution_steps": [
          "由$\\int_0^a 1\\,dx = b\\int_a^1 1\\,dx$得$a = b(1-a)$",
          "解得$a = \\frac{b}{1+b}$"
        ],
        "math_structure": {
          "type": "linear_equation",
          "template": "$a = b(1-a)$",
          "variable_count": 2
        },
        "difficulty": 1,
        "estimated_minutes": 3,
        "answer": [
          {
            "label": "求a",
            "steps": [
              "由$a = b(1-a) = b - ba$得$a + ba = b$",
              "即$a(1+b) = b$",
              "因此$a = \\frac{b}{1+b}$"
            ]
          }
        ],
        "id": "kobe-2025-3dacc32c2e-q01-practice-01",
        "school": "神户大学",
        "year": "2025"
      },
      {
        "text": "设$f(x) = x$，$b = 1$。证明存在$a \\in [0,1]$使得$\\int_0^a x\\,dx = \\int_a^1 x\\,dx$，并求$a$的值。",
        "knowledge_points": [
          "定积分计算",
          "积分方程"
        ],
        "question_type": "证明与计算",
        "method": [
          "计算定积分",
          "建立方程求解"
        ],
        "solution_steps": [
          "由$\\int_0^a x\\,dx = \\int_a^1 x\\,dx$得$\\frac{a^2}{2} = \\frac{1}{2} - \\frac{a^2}{2}$",
          "解得$a^2 = \\frac{1}{2}$"
        ],
        "math_structure": {
          "type": "integral_equation",
          "template": "$\\int_0^a x\\,dx = \\int_a^1 x\\,dx$",
          "variable_count": 1
        },
        "difficulty": 2,
        "estimated_minutes": 5,
        "answer": [
          {
            "label": "求a",
            "steps": [
              "$\\int_0^a x\\,dx = \\frac{a^2}{2}$，$\\int_a^1 x\\,dx = \\frac{1-a^2}{2}$",
              "由$\\frac{a^2}{2} = \\frac{1-a^2}{2}$得$a^2 = \\frac{1}{2}$",
              "因此$a = \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}} = \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}$（取正值）"
            ]
          }
        ],
        "id": "kobe-2025-3dacc32c2e-q01-practice-02",
        "school": "神户大学",
        "year": "2025"
      },
      {
        "text": "设$f(x) = e^{-x}$，$b = 1$。证明存在$a \\in [0,1]$使得$\\int_0^a e^{-x}dx = \\int_a^1 e^{-x}dx$，并求$a$的值。",
        "knowledge_points": [
          "指数函数积分",
          "积分方程"
        ],
        "question_type": "证明与计算",
        "method": [
          "计算指数函数积分",
          "建立超越方程求解"
        ],
        "solution_steps": [
          "由$-e^{-a} + 1 = e^{-a} - e^{-1}$得$2e^{-a} = 1 + e^{-1}$",
          "即$e^{-a} = \\frac{1+e^{-1}}{2}$"
        ],
        "math_structure": {
          "type": "integral_equation",
          "template": "$\\int_0^a e^{-x}dx = \\int_a^1 e^{-x}dx$",
          "variable_count": 1
        },
        "difficulty": 3,
        "estimated_minutes": 6,
        "answer": [
          {
            "label": "求a",
            "steps": [
              "$\\int_0^a e^{-x}dx = 1 - e^{-a}$，$\\int_a^1 e^{-x}dx = e^{-a} - e^{-1}$",
              "由$1 - e^{-a} = e^{-a} - e^{-1}$得$2e^{-a} = 1 + e^{-1} = \\frac{e+1}{e}$",
              "因此$e^{-a} = \\frac{e+1}{2e}$，$a = -\\ln\\frac{e+1}{2e} = \\ln\\frac{2e}{e+1}$"
            ]
          }
        ],
        "id": "kobe-2025-3dacc32c2e-q01-practice-03",
        "school": "神户大学",
        "year": "2025"
      },
      {
        "text": "设$f(x) = \\frac{1}{1+x}$，$b = 2$。证明存在$a \\in [0,1]$使得$\\int_0^a \\frac{1}{1+x}dx = 2\\int_a^1 \\frac{1}{1+x}dx$，并求$a$的值。",
        "knowledge_points": [
          "对数函数积分",
          "积分方程"
        ],
        "question_type": "证明与计算",
        "method": [
          "计算对数函数积分",
          "建立对数方程求解"
        ],
        "solution_steps": [
          "由$\\ln(1+a) = 2[\\ln 2 - \\ln(1+a)]$得$3\\ln(1+a) = 2\\ln 2$",
          "即$\\ln(1+a) = \\frac{2}{3}\\ln 2$"
        ],
        "math_structure": {
          "type": "integral_equation",
          "template": "$\\int_0^a \\frac{1}{1+x}dx = 2\\int_a^1 \\frac{1}{1+x}dx$",
          "variable_count": 1
        },
        "difficulty": 3,
        "estimated_minutes": 6,
        "answer": [
          {
            "label": "求a",
            "steps": [
              "$\\int_0^a \\frac{1}{1+x}dx = \\ln(1+a)$，$\\int_a^1 \\frac{1}{1+x}dx = \\ln 2 - \\ln(1+a)$",
              "由$\\ln(1+a) = 2[\\ln 2 - \\ln(1+a)]$得$3\\ln(1+a) = 2\\ln 2 = \\ln 4$",
              "因此$\\ln(1+a) = \\frac{1}{3}\\ln 4 = \\ln 4^{1/3} = \\ln \\sqrt[3]{4}$",
              "所以$a = \\sqrt[3]{4} - 1$"
            ]
          }
        ],
        "id": "kobe-2025-3dacc32c2e-q01-practice-04",
        "school": "神户大学",
        "year": "2025"
      }
